r":-358},"title":"秦军在西山击败韩军"},{"aliases":["Battle of Issus","军事"],"body":["公元前333年，亚历山大在伊苏斯击败大流士三世亲自率领的波斯军。大流士迂回至其后方，威胁补给，亚历山大遂回军迎战。战场处于海湾与山地之间，河流横贯阵线，较狭地形限制大军展开，双方不能只按总兵力比较便推定胜负。","马其顿中部渡河时受到希腊雇佣兵重压，左翼也艰难支撑，亚历山大从右翼突破，进逼国王所在方向，迫使大流士逃离，再转向援助其他部队。败局扩大后，波斯财物及国王家属落入亚历山大手中。此战加强了亚历山大向叙利亚和东地中海沿岸推进的条件，但大流士仍然在位，帝国战争没有在伊苏斯立即结束。"],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[{"block_sha256":null,"field":"summary","locator":"MediaWiki API完整修订正文；page_id=227322，revision=1383040678；原始wikitext 行68–79、99–114","source_id":"PSRC-026b29791d5b4fe4b0f26ff5","status":"located"},{"block_sha256":null,"field":"body","locator":"MediaWiki API完整修订正文；page_id=227322，revision=1383040678；原始wikitext 行68–79、99–114","source_id":"PSRC-026b29791d5b4fe4b0f26ff5","status":"located"},{"block_sha256":null,"field":"body","locator":"MediaWiki API完整修订正文；page_id=783，revision=1384139640；原始wikitext 行314、331","source_id":"PSRC-543d715e977ba83365a3d1a6","status":"located"},{"block_sha256":null,"field":"title","locator":"可读正文块 1","source_id":"PSRC-7d9c5ed6922222ad1838c437","status":"located"},{"block_sha256":null,"field":"subject","locator":"可读正文块 1","source_id":"PSRC-7d9c5ed6922222ad1838c437","status":"located"},{"block_sha256":null,"field":"action","locator":"可读正文块 1","source_id":"PSRC-7d9c5ed6922222ad1838c437","status":"located"},{"block_sha256":null,"field":"time","locator":"可读正文块 1","source_id":"PSRC-7d9c5ed6922222ad1838c437","status":"located"},{"block_sha256":null,"field":"summary","locator":"可读正文块 1","source_id":"PSRC-7d9c5ed6922222ad1838c437","status":"located"}],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6e001fcb4a024500093ffbbc","images":[],"map_reference":{"checked_at":"2026-10-23","kind":"site_area","label":"伊蘇斯戰役·场址区域参照","latitude":36.837894,"license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","longitude":36.211109,"note":"事件或场址所在区域参照；逐项比较本记录行动、所引来源条目和地理实体；直接采用同一事件或固定场址的P625，仅表示所在区域，不代表全部战线、建筑边界或精确行动点。 地理补录